Boom Buster - Decompilation
===========================

This repository contains a decompilation of the game Boom Buster.

The original game, including its code, art, audio, levels, and all other
content, is Copyright (c) 2026 Tallglass. All rights reserved.

This decompilation is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tallglass. No
license is granted to the original game's code or assets by this repository.
All rights to that material remain with their respective owners.

Third-party components bundled with the game are distributed under their own
licenses, which are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt:

  - Input by Juju Adams and Alynne Keith (MIT License)
      scripts/__input_*, datafiles/input_license.txt
  - SDL2 controller type list by Sam Lantinga (zlib License)
      datafiles/controllertypes.csv
  - SDL_GameControllerDB (zlib License)
      datafiles/sdl2.txt
  - Chromium controller blocklist by The Chromium Authors (BSD 3-Clause License)
      datafiles/controllerblacklist.csv
